  "idea": "Ollama: run powerful AI models completely free on your laptop",
  "text": "The free tool that installs and runs open-source models in just one command. Testing new models usually requires downloading huge checkpoints and debugging broken Python libraries for hours. A single mismatched GPU driver can crash your machine before generating even one response. Ollama solves this by packaging model weights and execution into a single lightweight background service. You spin up local intelligence in under sixty seconds.",
